/*
==============================================================================

ITEMS.QC - public API

Prototypes for the shared pickup/respawn scaffolding defined in
src/items/items.qc. This header is pulled in from defs.qc, so every
item file (item_armor.qc, and any item_*.qc added later) inherits these
functions and can call them regardless of where it sits in progs.src.

==============================================================================
*/

float() CheckValidTouch;
void() StartItem;
void() ItemRespawn;
void() ItemTouched;
